{"unit_id": "zhou914485__dsh-event-chime#feature-1", "repo": "zhou914485/dsh-event-chime", "commit": "a819f004203440ccce37913207f9b180066eb9a5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "事件提示音的「会话事件提醒」功能：监听会话状态，并在回合完成、后台会话完成、授权、提问或计划评审等状态出现时触发对应音频池。事件依据会话状态快照判定。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:494"]}
{"unit_id": "zhou914485__dsh-event-chime#feature-2", "repo": "zhou914485/dsh-event-chime", "commit": "a819f004203440ccce37913207f9b180066eb9a5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "事件提示音的「音频池管理」功能：在设置面板按事件启用或清空音频池、试听条目，并导入本机音频；本机音频以 Blob 记录在浏览器 IndexedDB。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:111", "client.js:598"]}
{"unit_id": "zhou914485__dsh-event-chime#feature-3", "repo": "zhou914485/dsh-event-chime", "commit": "a819f004203440ccce37913207f9b180066eb9a5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "事件提示音的「音频轮换」功能：为每个事件池选择洗牌、随机或顺序播放；音频池没有可播放条目时可回退到对应的 Web Audio 合成提示音。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:209", "client.js:247"]}
{"unit_id": "zhou914485__dsh-event-chime#feature-4", "repo": "zhou914485/dsh-event-chime", "commit": "a819f004203440ccce37913207f9b180066eb9a5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "事件提示音的「内置音频包」功能：Host 提供只读音频清单和文件路由，客户端读取清单并将包内音频加入事件池；可在设置中关闭内置音频混入。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:31", "index.js:86", "client.js:180"]}
{"unit_id": "zhou914485__dsh-event-chime#caveat-1", "repo": "zhou914485/dsh-event-chime", "commit": "a819f004203440ccce37913207f9b180066eb9a5", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "事件提示音把用户导入的音频 Blob 保存在浏览器 IndexedDB，设置保存在 localStorage；插件会从本机 DSH 路由读取随包分发的音频。源码未配置第三方服务或 API 密钥。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:81", "client.js:111", "client.js:180", "index.js:20"]}
